sequenceDiagram
%% Recognition Progressive Learning Flow (v3)
%% Combines identify suggestions and confirm → augment propagation loop

autonumber
participant WP as WordPress Plugin (Admin SPA)
participant Crop as ImageCropUtility
participant Embed as /api/v0/embeddings/batch
participant Suggest as /api/v0/suggest
participant Cluster as /api/v0/cluster-unknowns
participant Propagate as /api/v0/roster/augment
participant Queue as Propagation Queue
participant Worker as EmbeddingRefreshWorker
participant FAISS as FAISS Index
participant RemoteDB as RS_AUGMENTED_EMBEDDING
participant LocalDB as CAT_* Tables

Note over WP: Identify request
WP->>WP: Validate capability + resolve attachment
WP->>Crop: cropFaces(attachmentId, bboxes[])
Crop->>Crop: Crop & normalize regions (112x112)
Crop-->>WP: faceImages[]

WP->>Embed: POST /embeddings/batch {images, model}
Embed->>Embed: Run model → embeddings[]
Embed-->>WP: {embeddings: [...]} (per bounding box)

WP->>Suggest: POST /suggest {embeddings[], topK, threshold, sessionId}
Suggest->>FAISS: Load index + perform cosine search
FAISS-->>Suggest: matches[] with scores
Suggest-->>WP: suggestions[] + strategy_used

alt clustered fallback required
    WP->>Cluster: POST /cluster-unknowns {embeddings[]}
    Cluster-->>WP: clusterIds[]
end

WP->>WP: Merge suggestions + clusters
WP-->>WP: Render results (observations persisted locally)

Note over WP,LocalDB: Confirmation loop (user accepts identity)
WP->>LocalDB: Update CAT_OBSERVATION status=confirmed
WP->>LocalDB: Queue sync action (CAT_SYNC_QUEUE)
WP->>Propagate: POST /roster/augment {remotePersonId, embedding, source="observation", quality="high", observationRemoteId}
Propagate->>RemoteDB: Persist augmented embedding
Propagate->>Queue: Publish propagation event (embedding_id)
Propagate-->>WP: {success: true, sync_queued: true}

Note over Queue: Durable retry with exponential backoff
Queue-->>Worker: Deliver event when available
Worker->>FAISS: Refresh index with new embedding
Worker->>RemoteDB: Mark embedding as applied
Worker-->>Queue: Ack event (mark applied)
Worker-->>LocalDB: (optional webhook) notify sync success

Worker-->>WP: (webhook) confirm cascade ready
WP->>WP: Promote cascaded drafts (pending_review → suggested)

Note over WP: UI cache warmed (session/localStorage) once acknowledgement received
